<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus tenders for wheat, corn.</title>
<headline>Cyprus tenders for wheat, corn.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Monday issued tenders for the supply of a combined shipment of 14,000 tonnes of spring wheat and 8,000 tonnes of durum wheat, for shipment in September 1997.</p>
<p>It also issued tenders for the supply of 18,000 tonnes of corn, with shipment also scheduled for September.</p>
<p>A statement from the Grain Commission said tenders close on August 8 for both cargoes.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 469625</p>
